{
  "key": "letter-163-part-02",
  "number": 163,
  "generationId": "01a1e8e3-35f8-7d29-9a65-de170525518d",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Deepen the sensitivity.",
      "path": "audio/1971-163/11.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.312653
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Do not just swim in sensitivity, drown in it.",
      "path": "audio/1971-163/12.mp3",
      "start": 2.578526,
      "end": 5.19746
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "This I call meditation.",
      "path": "audio/1971-163/13.mp3",
      "start": 6.460544,
      "end": 7.924444
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "And, in meditation, the seen disappears and finally the seer too.",
      "path": "audio/1971-163/14.mp3",
      "start": 9.219342000000001,
      "end": 12.757347
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "There remains only the seeing.",
      "path": "audio/1971-163/15.mp3",
      "start": 14.071610000000002,
      "end": 15.571451
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "It is in this seeing that the invisible becomes visible and the unknown becomes known.",
      "path": "audio/1971-163/16.mp3",
      "start": 16.851247,
      "end": 20.990771000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Not only this - even the unknowable becomes knowable.",
      "path": "audio/1971-163/17.mp3",
      "start": 22.405442,
      "end": 25.936122
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "And remember that whatever I am writing - do not start thinking about this as well: act.",
      "path": "audio/1971-163/18.mp3",
      "start": 27.345805,
      "end": 33.416712
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Nothing has ever been nor can be attained by creating theories.",
      "path": "audio/1971-163/19.mp3",
      "start": 34.789184000000006,
      "end": 38.79644
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "There is no other door except 'seeing for oneself'",
      "path": "audio/1971-163/20.mp3",
      "start": 40.294082,
      "end": 43.83
    }
  ]
}
